{"id":"n67912-1-7","stage":5,"title":"왕궁 · 王宫","scene":"文化与休闲","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67912-1-7-1","ko":"어제 옛 왕궁을 구경하러 갔었어.","zh":"昨天我去参观了旧王宫。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"옛","meaning":"过去的，以前的","explanation":"옛：过去的，以前的","readings":[{"term":"옛","audio":"/audio/8ba213f5c49c4e15ce8a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28484","senseId":"1","lemma":"옛","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왕궁을","meaning":"王宫","explanation":"왕궁：王宫；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"왕궁","audio":"/audio/ce5ee32b6898a6008d00.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67912","senseId":"1","lemma":"왕궁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"구경하러","meaning":"观看，观赏，看热闹","explanation":"구경하다：观看，观赏，看热闹；러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"구경하다","audio":"/audio/a9fade8f610f2f6c2fec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62355","senseId":"1","lemma":"구경하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갔었어.","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；었었：回顾已经结束或与现在情况有区别的过去。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"8ba213f5c49c4e15","term":"옛","zh":"过去的，以前的","audio":"/audio/8ba213f5c49c4e15ce8a.mp3","entryId":"28484","definition":"过去的时候的。","pronunciation":["옏ː"]},{"id":"ce5ee32b6898a600","term":"왕궁","zh":"王宫","audio":"/audio/ce5ee32b6898a6008d00.mp3","entryId":"67912","definition":"王生活的宫殿。","pronunciation":["왕궁"]},{"id":"a9fade8f610f2f6c","term":"구경하다","zh":"观看，观赏，看热闹","audio":"/audio/a9fade8f610f2f6c2fec.mp3","entryId":"62355","definition":"带着兴趣或关心看。","pronunciation":["구ː경하다"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b073bb76f8243b050a5a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67912-1-7-2","ko":"어땠어? 아무래도 왕의 집이니 크고 화려하겠지?","zh":"感觉怎么样？既然是国王的居所，应该很大很华丽吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어땠어?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아무래도","meaning":"到底，还是","explanation":"아무래도：到底，还是","readings":[{"term":"아무래도","audio":"/audio/f5dbee1c946c5e6b1fa7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71330","senseId":"1","lemma":"아무래도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왕의","meaning":"王","explanation":"왕：王；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"왕","audio":"/audio/6014abd1dab738e0d2f9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66307","senseId":"1","lemma":"왕","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"집이니","meaning":"房子，窝，巢","explanation":"집：房子，窝，巢；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"1","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"크고","meaning":"大，高，长，壮阔","explanation":"크다：大，高，长，壮阔；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"1","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"화려하겠지?","meaning":"华丽","explanation":"화려하다：华丽；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"화려하다","audio":"/audio/e44483c48cde72bc2261.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73229","senseId":"1","lemma":"화려하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"f5dbee1c946c5e6b","term":"아무래도","zh":"到底，还是","audio":"/audio/f5dbee1c946c5e6b1fa7.mp3","entryId":"71330","definition":"不管怎么想；或指不管怎么做。","pronunciation":["아ː무래도"]},{"id":"6014abd1dab738e0","term":"왕","zh":"王","audio":"/audio/6014abd1dab738e0d2f9.mp3","entryId":"66307","definition":"在实行王位继承制的国家管理国家的人。","pronunciation":["왕"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"房子，窝，巢","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"人或动物为了遮寒挡暑等，进里面生活而盖的建筑物。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"大，高，长，壮阔","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66586","definition":"长度、宽度、高度、体积等都超出了普通程度。","pronunciation":["크다"]},{"id":"e44483c48cde72bc","term":"화려하다","zh":"华丽","audio":"/audio/e44483c48cde72bc2261.mp3","entryId":"73229","definition":"美丽好看，明亮耀眼，看起来好。","pronunciation":["화려하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ac609a64b2967f310f64.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.444,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67912","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":164,"sequenceScore":3.2707,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["感觉怎么样？既然是国王的居所，应该很大很华丽吧？","你的梦想是什么？","昨天我去参观了旧王宫。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["感觉怎么样？既然是国王的居所，应该很大很华丽吧？","昨天我去参观了旧王宫。","你的梦想是什么？"],"answer":0}]}
